title: Waste Wool
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki

Not every fleece can be spun. The short fibers and the discolored ones can't be made into yarn, and they usually get thrown out.

The [[Oka Chair]] stuffs its cushions with them, in place of petroleum foam.

There is waste wool everywhere sheep are raised.

[[Waste = Food]]. See [[Melissa Smith]], [[Willow Creek Farm]].
